Package: apbCatalogR
Title: Look Up APB Result Fields by Meaning
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Witold", "Wolski", , "wew@fgcz.ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6468-120X"))
Description: Reimplements the apb-catalog API on the bundle apb-catalog
    releases: apb2 parse rules, reviewed catalogues and expected answers.
    Reads Parquet results of the AnnData Proteomics Bridge into anndataR
    objects and finds the column holding a meaning, such as a PEP or an
    unnormalized intensity, without naming vendor columns.
